   "q": "<p>A student asked 40 families in her neighbourhood what they have in their emergency kits.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 280\" width=\"520\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Sütun grafiği: afet çantasındaki eşyalar\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><text x=\"260\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Items in the emergency kits of 40 families</text><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"230.0\" x2=\"505\" y2=\"230.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"234.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"182.5\" x2=\"505\" y2=\"182.5\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"186.5\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"end\">10</text><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"135.0\" x2=\"505\" y2=\"135.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"139.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"end\">20</text><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"87.5\" x2=\"505\" y2=\"87.5\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"91.5\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"end\">30</text><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"505\" y2=\"40.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"44.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"end\">40</text><rect x=\"70.5\" y=\"59.0\" width=\"50.1\" height=\"171.0\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" rx=\"3\"/><text x=\"95.5\" y=\"246\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">water</text><rect x=\"161.5\" y=\"87.5\" width=\"50.1\" height=\"142.5\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" rx=\"3\"/><text x=\"186.5\" y=\"246\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">torch</text><rect x=\"252.5\" y=\"116.0\" width=\"50.1\" height=\"114.0\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" rx=\"3\"/><text x=\"277.5\" y=\"246\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">first aid</text><text x=\"277.5\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">kit</text><rect x=\"343.5\" y=\"173.0\" width=\"50.1\" height=\"57.0\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" rx=\"3\"/><text x=\"368.5\" y=\"246\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">whistle</text><rect x=\"434.5\" y=\"192.0\" width=\"50.1\" height=\"38.0\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" rx=\"3\"/><text x=\"459.5\" y=\"246\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">radio</text><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"505\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"135\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 14 135)\">number of families</text></svg></div><p><b>According to the chart, which of the following is CORRECT?</b></p>",
